      "id": "bk2-der-110",
      "q": "A patient with detachment, two mucosal sites involved and transaminitis needs?",
      "o": [
        "Topical antibiotic alone",
        "Urgent referral to a burn or intensive unit with eye review",
        "Outpatient antihistamines only",
        "Reassurance without follow-up"
      ],
      "a": 1,
      "exp": "Mucosal plus systemic involvement with detachment is severe disease needing intensive, ophthalmic and nutritional support.",
      "r": [
        "Incorrect. Topicals miss systemic care.",
        "Correct. Severe disease needs intensive referral.",
        "Incorrect. Antihistamines miss organ injury.",
        "Incorrect. Follow-up is mandatory."
      ],
      "kp": "Mucosal plus systemic detachment needs referral.",
